<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - People's Bank starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - People's Bank starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said Tuesday analyst Ken Posner had started coverage of People's Bank of Bridgeport, Conn., with a rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed on Monday at 34-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
